{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33929","headline":"吴中言情寄鲁望 · 皮日休","name":"吴中言情寄鲁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古来伧父爱吴乡，一上胥台不可忘。\n爱酒有情如手足，除诗无计似膏肓。\n宴时不辍琅书味，斋日难判玉鱠香。\n爲说松江堪老处，满船烟月湿莎裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}